<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Profit Leak Fazit</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --gold:#b7a36a;
    --gold-soft:#d9c993;
    --black:#000000;
    --bg:#050505;
    --panel:#0b0b0b;
    --line:#2b2618;
    --text:#f7f3e6;
    --muted:#8a8374;
    --good:#2f8f5b;
    --warn:#c08a2c;
    --bad:#b85757;
    --shadow-soft:0 26px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.85);
    --titleFont:"Century Gothic","Trebuchet MS",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --bodyFont:Calibri,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    height:100%;
  }

  body{
    font-family:var(--bodyFont);
    background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#151515 0%, #050505 45%, #000 100%);
    color:var(--text);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:flex-start;
    min-height:100vh;
  }

  .wrap{
    width:100%;
    max-width:960px;
    padding:32px 16px 40px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:16px;
  }

  .header{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }

  .header-title{
    font-family:var(--titleFont);
    font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,34px);
    letter-spacing:.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold);
    margin:0 0 6px;
  }

  .header-sub{
    margin:0;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--muted);
  }

  .result-card{
    background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#17130b 0%,#050505 55%,#020202 100%);
    border:1px solid rgba(183,163,106,.65);
    border-radius:28px;
    padding:22px 18px 24px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);
    color:var(--text);
  }

  .result-card h2{
    margin:0 0 12px;
    font-family:var(--titleFont);
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:22px;
    text-align:center;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }

  .result-card .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1.8fr;
    gap:18px;
  }

  .box{
    background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#151515 0%,#050505 60%,#010101 100%);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:13px 13px 15px;
  }

  .label{
    font-size:11px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }

  .value{
    font-size:15px;
    color:#fef9e6;
    font-weight:700;
  }

  .full{
    grid-column:1 / -1;
  }

  .pill-meta{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    padding:4px 9px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    font-size:11px;
    color:#e8e0c7;
  }

  .pill-meta span:first-child{
    width:7px;
    height:7px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--gold);
  }

  /* Gauge complessivo */
  .gauge-wrapper{
    margin-top:12px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  .gauge-circle{
    position:relative;
    width:180px;
    height:180px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at center,#000 0%,#050505 60%,#000 100%);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  .gauge-circle svg{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
  }

  .gauge-bg{
    stroke:#2b2b2b;
    stroke-width:10;
    fill:none;
    opacity:0.85;
  }

  .gauge-fg{
    stroke:url(#gaugeGradient);
    stroke-width:10;
    fill:none;
    stroke-linecap:round;
    transform:rotate(-90deg);
    transform-origin:50% 50%;
  }

  .gauge-center{
    position:relative;
    text-align:center;
    z-index:1;
  }

  .gauge-center .gauge-value{
    font-size:30px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--gold-soft);
  }

  .gauge-center .gauge-label{
    font-size:11px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    color:#d3c69a;
  }

  .gauge-caption{
    margin-top:8px;
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted);
    text-align:center;
  }

  /* Leak list mini gauge */
  .leak-list{
    margin:8px 0 0;
    padding:0;
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:7px;
  }

  .leak-item{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:3px;
  }

  .leak-item-title{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    font-size:12px;
    color:#f7f3df;
  }

  .leak-item-bar{
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    height:8px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:#252525;
    overflow:hidden;
  }

  .leak-item-fill{
    position:absolute;
    top:0;
    left:0;
    height:100%;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7c6a35,#b7a36a,#f3e3a4);
  }

  .benchmark-text{
    font-size:14px;
    line-height:1.5;
    color:#f1e8d1;
  }

  .benchmark-tag{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-bottom:6px;
    padding:3px 9px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-size:11px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);
  }

  .benchmark-tag.good{color:#7bd9a3;border-color:#2f8f5b;}
  .benchmark-tag.warn{color:#f6d082;border-color:#c08a2c;}
  .benchmark-tag.bad{color:#f1a6a6;border-color:#b85757;}

  .next-step-text{
    font-size:14px;
    line-height:1.5;
    color:#f5edd8;
  }

  .footer-note{
    margin-top:14px;
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted);
    text-align:center;
  }

  @media (max-width:720px){
    .result-card .grid{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
    .result-card{
      padding:18px 14px 20px;
      border-radius:22px;
    }
    .gauge-circle{
      width:160px;
      height:160px;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="header">
    <h1 class="header-title">Profit Leak Fazit</h1>
    <p class="header-sub">Auswertung Ihres Quick Checks – auf einen Blick.</p>
  </header>

  <section id="resultCard" class="result-card" aria-label="Fazit"></section>

  <p class="footer-note">
    Hinweis: Diese Auswertung ersetzt keine individuelle Beratung, zeigt aber klar, wo sich ein genauer Blick besonders lohnt.
  </p>
</div>

<script>
  function escapeHtml(str){
    if(!str && str!==0) return "";
    return String(str).replace(/[&<>"'`=\/]/g, function(s) {
      return ({
        '&': '&amp;',
        '<': '&lt;',
        '>': '&gt;',
        '"': '&quot;',
        "'": '&#39;',
        '/': '&#x2F;',
        '`': '&#x60;',
        '=': '&#x3D;'
      })[s];
    });
  }

  function leakName(key){
    const map={
      pricing:"Pricing Leak",
      cost:"Cost Leak",
      workingCapital:"Working Capital Drag",
      process:"Process Inefficiency",
      positioning:"Strategic Positioning Gap"
    };
    return map[key] || "–";
  }

  function leakRanking(leaks){
    return Object.entries(leaks || {})
      .sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1])
      .filter(x=>x[1]>0)
      .map(x=>({key:x[0],score:x[1]}));
  }

  function classifyBenchmark(text){
    if(!text) return "warn";
    const lower = text.toLowerCase();
    if(lower.includes("level 1") || lower.includes("level 2")) return "good";
    if(lower.includes("level 3")) return "warn";
    return "bad";
  }

  function interpretNextStep(readiness){
    if(!readiness) return "—";
    const u = readiness.urgency;
    const s = readiness.speed;
    if(u === 0 || u === null) return "—";

    if(u === 1 || s === 1){
      return "Hohe Dringlichkeit: Ein strukturierter Deep-Dive in Pricing, Prozess- und Liquiditätsthemen lohnt sich kurzfristig.";
    }
    if(u === 2 || s === 2){
      return "Relevanz in den nächsten Wochen: Eine fokussierte Analyse mit konkreten Maßnahmenplänen empfiehlt sich innerhalb von 30 Tagen.";
    }
    if(u === 3){
      return "Dieses Jahr relevant: Ein geplanter, aber nicht akuter vertiefender Check bietet sich im Rahmen Ihrer Jahresplanung an.";
    }
    return "Erst Orientierung: Das Fazit dient als Kompass, um Prioritäten und nächste Schritte im eigenen Tempo zu definieren.";
  }

  function renderCard(payload){
    const resultCard = document.getElementById("resultCard");
    if(!payload){
      resultCard.innerHTML = `
        <h2>Keine Daten</h2>
        <p class="benchmark-text">Es wurden keine Auswertungsdaten übergeben. Bitte öffnen Sie diese Seite über den Link aus dem Quick Check.</p>
      `;
      return;
    }

    const leaks = payload.leaks || {};
    const ranking = leakRanking(leaks);
    const top = ranking[0];
    const maxScore = ranking.length ? ranking[0].score : 0;

    // Gesamt-Leak-Intensität (0–100%) – normalisiert auf einen fiktiven Maximalwert
    const maxPossible = 10;
    const percent = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Math.round((maxScore / maxPossible) * 100)));

    const leakListHTML = ranking.length
      ? ranking.map(r=>{
          const p = Math.max(5, Math.min(100, Math.round((r.score / maxPossible) * 100)));
          return `
            <li class="leak-item">
              <div class="leak-item-title">
                <span>${leakName(r.key)}</span>
                <span>${r.score}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="leak-item-bar">
                <div class="leak-item-fill" style="width:${p}%;"></div>
              </div>
            </li>
          `;
        }).join("")
      : `<li class="leak-item">
           <div class="leak-item-title"><span>Keine Risiken ermittelt</span></div>
         </li>`;

    const benchText = payload.benchmark || "–";
    const benchClass = classifyBenchmark(benchText);
    const nextStep = interpretNextStep(payload.readiness);

    resultCard.innerHTML = `
      <h2>Fazit</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="box">
          <div class="label">Unternehmen</div>
          <div class="value">${escapeHtml(payload.companyName || "Ihr Unternehmen")}</div>

          <div class="label" style="margin-top:10px;">Top Leak</div>
          <div class="value">${escapeHtml(payload.topLeak || (top ? leakName(top.key) : "–"))}</div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px;">
            <span class="pill-meta">
              <span></span>
              <span>Quick Check – Profit Leak Profil</span>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="gauge-wrapper" aria-label="Gesamt-Leak-Intensität">
            <div class="gauge-circle">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="gaugeGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7c6a35"/>
                    <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#b7a36a"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f3e3a4"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                </defs>
                <circle class="gauge-bg" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"
                        stroke-dasharray="251.2"
                        stroke-dashoffset="0"></circle>
                <circle class="gauge-fg" cx="50" cy="50" r="40"
                        stroke-dasharray="251.2"
                        stroke-dashoffset="${251.2 - (251.2 * percent / 100)}"></circle>
              </svg>
              <div class="gauge-center">
                <div class="gauge-value">${percent}<span style="font-size:16px;">%</span></div>
                <div class="gauge-label">Leak-Intensität</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gauge-caption">
              Je höher der Wert, desto stärker konzentrieren sich Gewinn- und Liquiditätslecks in den identifizierten Bereichen.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box full">
          <div class="label">Benchmark</div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="benchmark-tag ${benchClass}">${escapeHtml((payload.benchmark || "Benchmark").split(":")[0])}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="benchmark-text">
            ${escapeHtml(benchText)}
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="box full">
          <div class="label">Ranking nach Profit Leaks</div>
          <div class="value">
            <ul class="leak-list">
              ${leakListHTML}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box full">
          <div class="label">Konkreter nächster Schritt</div>
          <p class="next-step-text">${escapeHtml(nextStep)}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
  }

  // Daten aus der URL lesen: ?data=...
  (function init(){
    try{
      const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      const raw = params.get("data");
      if(!raw){
        renderCard(null);
        return;
      }
      const decoded = decodeURIComponent(raw);
      const payload = JSON.parse(decoded);
      renderCard(payload);
    }catch(e){
      console.error(e);
      renderCard(null);
    }
  })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
